    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/611c6abe1b32df1b0653b9844dcc5fbe.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=400 /></span><strong>Friday Fever</strong> is a vibrant and visually striking visual novel with puzzle elements that will immerse you in a world of unexpected encounters and thrilling surprises. Beneath the vibrant exterior, a darker, more twisted reality awaits \u2014 a hellish brothel where suffering and lust intertwine in a volatile mix. Here, the air is thick with temptation and torment, where every pleasure is tainted with pain, and every desire brings its own punishment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/c895c520304eaf20b481e71361d82f1b.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>Prospero, an eccentric brothel owner who loves to shock and surprise his clientele, has recently introduced his latest captive\u2014a beast of legend. Straight from the dark, forgotten woods, he presents an ancient satyr, straight out of myth and folklore. Wasting no time, Prospero prepares an unforgettable show for his VIP clients, pairing his tiny, innocent prot\u00e9g\u00e9e with the well-hung beast in a spectacle of primal urges and forbidden passions. But there may be more to this new arrival than meets the eye\u2014perhaps she wasn\u2019t captured by chance, and a darker, more sinister plan is unfolding behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/9e240774027fbdf84660353c10c476b2.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/1ffdcd7dbe5b1e59e355ce355a7a9da4.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/d3b9a22902985858e8072dbab764d4db.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/11cb1b825b39d062af79ef9eb0d06c10.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/dc75db4546420df0045b9830d5a6ea2d.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=615 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/2eb22e21cc05bc2c6181ae073ae4c594.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=202 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204510/extras/02f54f63e52af196f3ab9876c4fbe971.avif?t=1736839070\" width=615 height=202 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Visual Novel Experience: Dive into a rich story filled with captivating characters, vibrant visuals, and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Jigsaw Puzzles: Solve jigsaw puzzles that enhance the storytelling and reveal stunning artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Art and Design: Enjoy beautifully crafted visuals that bring the world of Friday Fever to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Soundtrack: Enjoy a carefully curated soundtrack that sets the mood and enhances every scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-Handed Play Mode: Designed for comfort, so you can fully immerse yourself in the experience\u2026 with one hand free for other activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of sin and shadows, where lust and suffering coexist, every choice draws you deeper into the abyss. Can you navigate the delicate balance between pleasure and pain, or will you be consumed by the darkness within?</p></li></ul>",
